ts.\",\n      \"target\": \"Tech ethicists, policymakers, and social justice advocates\",\n      \"relevanceScore\": 0.7\n    },\n    {\n      \"perspective\": \"The Startup Disruptor\",\n      \"approach\": \"Profile AI healthcare startups racing to commercialize diagnostic tools, analyzing the billion-dollar market and regulatory hurdles.\",\n      \"target\": \"Investors, entrepreneurs, and business readers\",\n      \"relevanceScore\": 0.6\n    },\n    {\n      \"perspective\": \"The Global Health Equalizer\",\n      \"approach\": \"Document how AI tools are being deployed in rural clinics and developing nations to bridge healthcare gaps where specialists are scarce.\",\n      \"target\": \"International development professionals and public health advocates\",\n      \"relevanceScore\": 0.75\n    }\n  ],\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"How do we ensure AI diagnostic tools are trained on diverse patient data to avoid racial and gender bias?\",\n      \"type\": \"analytical\",\n      \"depth\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"What ethical framework should govern when an AI recommendation overrides a doctor's clinical judgment?\",\n      \"type\": \"analytical\",\n      \"depth\": \"deep\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"What specific steps can hospitals take this year to begin implementing AI diagnostic tools while maintaining patient trust?\",\n      \"type\": \"practical\",\n      \"depth\": \"surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"How should medical schools update their curriculum to prepare future doctors for AI-augmented practice?\",\n      \"type\": \"practical\",\n      \"depth\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Does AI-assisted medicine fundamentally change what it means to be a healer, or is it just another tool in the medical toolkit?\",\n      \"type\": \"philosophical\",\n      \"depth\": \"deep\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"If AI can diagnose diseases earlier and more accurately, do doctors have an 