l obligation to use it despite potential risks?\",\n      \"type\": \"philosophical\",\n      \"depth\": \"deep\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"How does the adoption curve of AI in healthcare compare to previous medical revolutions like X-rays or antibiotics?\",\n      \"type\": \"comparative\",\n      \"depth\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"What can healthcare learn from other industries (like aviation or finance) about safely integrating AI into high-stakes decision making?\",\n      \"type\": \"comparative\",\n      \"depth\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"personalization\": {\n    \"matchedTopics\": [],\n    \"adjustedFor\": \"intermediate expertise\",\n    \"targetWordCount\": 1000,\n    \"voice\": \"first-person\",\n    \"relevanceToUser\": 0.5\n  }\n}",
